Source: libpam-duress
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: David <nuvious@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libpam0g-dev, libssl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.1
Homepage: https://github.com/nuvious/pam-duress/
Rules-Requires-Root: no
#Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/debian/pam-duress-2.0.0.git
#Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/debian/pam-duress-2.0.0

Package: libpam-duress
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: PAM module which allows the establishment of
 alternate passwords that can be used to perform actions to
 clear sensitive data, notify IT/Security staff, close off
 sensitive network connections, etc if a user is coerced
 into giving a threat actor a password.

Package: libpam-duress-bin
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: PAM module which allows the establishment of
 alternate passwords that can be used to perform actions to
 clear sensitive data, notify IT/Security staff, close off
 sensitive network connections, etc if a user is coerced
 into giving a threat actor a password.
